{# Skill pack: mass_assignment #}
## Skill: Mass Assignment
applies_when: Use when request bodies map directly onto internal objects.
target_under_test: {{ target }}
difficulty_level: {{ difficulty_level }}

signals:
  - JSON bodies with a subset of model fields; role or status fields present in responses
probe_order:
  1. Capture the legitimate update request
  2. Add privileged fields (role, is_admin, tenant, verified, balance)
  3. Read the object back to confirm persistence
validation_criteria:
  - an added field is accepted and persisted
evidence_required:
  - update request, read-back response
